<script>
import Code from '#src/lib/Code.abide'
import Doc from '#src/lib/Doc.abide'
import Section from '#src/lib/Section.abide'
</script>

<Doc
    seeAlso={['/components/tooltip', '/components/toasts', '/helpers/popover']}
    tests={[
        {
            path: 'packages/dogfood/examples/crm/src/pipeline/lib/StageHints.test.ts',
            from: [
                "test('a stage is described by its hint, with nothing written beside it'",
            ],
        },
        {
            path: 'packages/dogfood/e2e/chart.spec.ts',
            from: [
                'test("a pointer moving under a chart\'s readout keeps it open — 50.48"',
            ],
        },
    ]}
>
    <Section level={3} title="Show every hint of the app in one popover">
        <p>Render <code>Tooltips</code> once, in the root layout, and style it there. Every
            <code>tooltip</code> on every page opens in it, one at a time, in the top layer, so no
            scroller clips it.</p>
        <Code language="abide" caption="abide" code={`
            <script>
            import Tooltips from '@abide/abide/Tooltips.abide'
            </script>

            <html lang="en">
                <body>
                    <slot />
                    <Tooltips class="m-0 w-max max-w-60 rounded-md px-3 py-2 shadow-sm" />
                </body>
            </html>
        `} />
    </Section>

    <Section level={3} title="Draw an arrow pointing at the anchor">
        <p>The popover carries the side it took as <code>data-side</code>, and
            <code>--arrow-offset</code> is where along that edge the anchor's middle falls.
            <code>arrowInset</code> on a <code>tooltip</code> keeps the arrow off the rounded
            corners.</p>
        <Code language="abide" caption="abide" code={`
            <script>
            import Tooltips from '@abide/abide/Tooltips.abide'
            </script>

            <Tooltips
                class="m-0 overflow-visible rounded-md px-3 py-2
                before:absolute before:left-(--arrow-offset) before:size-2
                before:-translate-x-1/2 before:rotate-45 before:bg-raised
                data-[side=top]:before:-bottom-1
                data-[side=bottom]:before:-top-1"
            />
        `} />
    </Section>
</Doc>
